WEBVTT

00:03:59.496 --> 00:04:00.913
[Khud hone ke lie
dhanyavaad,

00:04:00.913 --> 00:04:03.121
main aapake lie yahaan
rahoonga chaahe aap

00:04:03.121 --> 00:04:05.079
kitnee bhee bahaat karne
chaahate hon.]

00:04:05.079 --> 00:04:08.538
[Dhanyavaad, hamen gadabad
karane ke lie anumati...]

00:04:09.038 --> 00:04:10.413
Aap soch rahe honge

00:04:10.954 --> 00:04:12.538
Agar main sun raha hoon

00:04:12.538 --> 00:04:14.746
main apane dost ka 
samarthan karana ke lie

00:04:14.746 --> 00:04:17.329
kya kar sakata hoon?

00:04:17.329 --> 00:04:19.538
Shuruaat ke life, suno

00:04:19.538 --> 00:04:21.871
Meherabeen dil aur kaan ke saath

00:04:21.871 --> 00:04:24.038
Vishisht bhaasha ke lie suno

00:04:24.038 --> 00:04:26.079
jo vo unhee aapko upayog

00:04:26.079 --> 00:04:27.121
kar raha hai

00:04:27.121 --> 00:04:29.121
Vohee bhaasha hai 
jo aapako unake saath

00:04:29.121 --> 00:04:30.621
prayog karanee chaahie